---
import RolePage from '../../components/pages/RolePage.astro';
---

<RolePage
  lang="en"
  title="For volunteer coordinators — Rondo"
  description="Rondo for volunteer coordinators: plan shifts, members sign up themselves, automatic reminders and a constant view of coverage."
  kicker="For your role"
  roleTitle="Volunteer coordinator"
  intro="Plan the entire volunteer season ahead, open signup separately for each half and adjust from one up-to-date overview. Members choose a shift themselves or you assign someone directly."
  demoLabel="Look at the demo"
  contactLabel="Contact us"
  contactHref="/en/contact/"
  screenshotSrc="/screenshot-vrijwilligers-planning.jpg"
  screenshotAlt="Season planning with daily coverage in Rondo Club"
  screenshotWidth={1926}
  screenshotHeight={1147}
  secondaryScreenshotSrc="/screenshot-vrijwilligers-statistieken.jpg"
  secondaryScreenshotAlt="Volunteer statistics with coverage and signup trend in Rondo Club"
  secondaryScreenshotWidth={1926}
  secondaryScreenshotHeight={1147}
  screenshotLayout="landscapePair"
  whatHeading="What this solves"
  bulletPoints={[
    'Plan the entire season ahead. Self-signup opens separately for each half; as coordinator, you can assign members directly in either half.',
    'Members choose a shift themselves, while the complete sortable signup overview shows who is scheduled where.',
    'Each volunteer can download their own schedule with all non-cancelled shifts as an iCalendar file, with correct times and a link back to Rondo.',
    'The dashboard shows signups, unique volunteers, fill rate, signup trend, task distribution and volunteer-obligation progress per season.',
    'Fill rate is the number of current signups divided by all available slots; upcoming shortages show open slots in the next 30 days.',
    'Official NOC*NSF IVA certificates that Rondo recognizes can be approved automatically. Photos, screenshots, other files and Social Hygiene diplomas are reviewed manually; approved evidence remains valid.',
    'Automatic reminders beforehand, and when someone cancels within the cancellation window, the other volunteers on that shift are notified automatically.',
  ]}
  cards={[
    { title: 'Plan and fill', text: 'Roll out recurring shifts for the season, open self-signup separately for each half and assign someone directly where needed.' },
    { title: 'Monitor', text: 'Compare filled and available slots, track obligation progress and see by task type and season where coverage falls behind.' },
    { title: 'Follow up', text: 'Act on upcoming shortages from the dashboard; Rondo handles reminders and keeps certificate review and cancellations visible.' },
  ]}
  otherHeading="Other paths"
  otherPrefix="Also relevant:"
  otherAnd="and"
  otherLinks={[
    { href: '/en/for-secretary/', label: 'For secretaries' },
    { href: '/en/for-board-it/', label: 'For board & IT' },
  ]}
  hasExtra={true}
>
  <div class="iva-evidence role-container">
    <div class="iva-evidence-copy">
      <h2 class="gradient-text iva-evidence-heading">Automatic where possible, reviewed where necessary</h2>
      <p>
        Rondo recognizes supported official IVA PDFs from NOC*NSF and VrijwilligerswerkNL. Automatic approval only
        follows when the name matches the member and the completion date is no more than two years old. An unknown
        format, different name or older date safely enters manual review.
      </p>
      <p>
        Photos, screenshots and Social Hygiene diplomas are always checked by an authorized reviewer. They receive one
        direct review link; after approval, the evidence remains valid without an invented expiry date and the member
        is notified that bar shifts are available.
      </p>
    </div>
    <figure class="iva-evidence-shot">
      <img
        class="zoomable-screenshot"
        src="/screenshot-iva-sociale-hygiene.jpg"
        alt="IVA certificate and Social Hygiene diploma management with status and review"
        width="1926"
        height="350"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </figure>
  </div>
</RolePage>

<style>
  .iva-evidence {
    max-width: 72rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .iva-evidence-copy {
    max-width: 54rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .iva-evidence-heading {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.6vw, 2.1rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .iva-evidence-copy p {
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
  }

  .iva-evidence-shot {
    border: 1px solid #D8E3EE;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(0, 27, 96, 0.16);
  }

  .iva-evidence-shot img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }
</style>
